      "comment": "Pir Kavikavus: Aralohita",
      "content": "A historical Aranara who accompanied Pir Kavikavus while he lived. After his accident Aralohita saved part of his research and locked it behind riddles and puzzles, a pastime Aranara are fond of. Aralohita survived whatever happened to him, but Aralohita's own fate is unknown. Ararycan traced Aralohita's last known location, which let the Traveler recover the research paper in Until Vana is Healed.",
